  "term": "F Scale",
  "definition": "The F Scale, in this packet, refers to the Fat Phobia Scale, a questionnaire used to measure negative attitudes or stigma toward people living with obesity. It was used as an indicator of anti-fat attitudes among healthcare professionals.",
